d3d11: draw point-mode tessellation

Applies on top of 0008.

FinalizeTessellationRenderPipeline refused hull shaders with point output
(UnsupportedTessellationOutputPrimitive) although the converter already
emits the point mesh path (generatePrimitivePoint, point rasterization).
With the refusal gone the probe's point-mode case matches WARP pixel for
pixel.  Line output (isolines) stays refused: there is no line generator.

--- a/src/d3d11/d3d11_context_impl.cpp
+++ b/src/d3d11/d3d11_context_impl.cpp
@@ -5050,11 +5050,6 @@
         enc.setCompatibilityFlag(FeatureCompatibility::UnsupportedTessellationOutputPrimitive);
       });
       return DrawCallStatus::Invalid;
-    case MTL_TESSELLATOR_OUTPUT_POINT:
-      EmitST([](ArgumentEncodingContext &enc) {
-        enc.setCompatibilityFlag(FeatureCompatibility::UnsupportedTessellationOutputPrimitive);
-      });
-      return DrawCallStatus::Invalid;
     default:
       break;
     }
